    "Scouting Notes": "Fastball looks similar to Brandon Woodruff's movement wise. Some \"rise\" and some run.\n Velo is down significantly in 2025. Sitting upper 80's instead of being in the 93 95 range.\n Looks to be out of shape\n Appears to really be able to spin it still, I'd say the slider is a better pitch than the curve currently\n Changeup is super inconsistent but has some flashes\n Slider is the only pitch that shows chances of being above average right now\n Walks are stlll reasonable, huge improvement year to year, but the command within the zone is not very good.\n GB rate has been going down\n Losing faith quickly in this one",
